QB.set("dic-sweets", {"title":"Caselet: Annapurna Foods","kind":"passage","text":"Annapurna Foods sells snacks through three cities: Pune, Nashik and Nagpur. In 2022 its total sales were ₹240 lakh, divided among Pune, Nashik and Nagpur in the ratio 5 : 4 : 3.\n\nIn 2023, Pune's sales rose by 20% over its 2022 sales, Nashik's sales fell by 25% from its 2022 sales, and Nagpur's sales rose by ₹12 lakh. The company's total costs in 2023 were 75% of its total sales for 2023."});
QB.set("dic-vidya", {"title":"Caselet: Vidya Tech headcount","kind":"passage","text":"Vidya Tech had 500 employees at the end of 2019. Its headcount in 2020 was 20% higher than in 2019, and in 2021 it was 25% higher than in 2020. In 2022 the company let go 10% of its 2021 staff, and in 2023 it hired 115 more people than its 2022 headcount."});
