QB.set("div-club", {"title":"Sports club survey","kind":"passage","text":"A sports club has 250 members. Of them, 140 play cricket, 110 play football and 90 play badminton. 50 play both cricket and football, 40 play both football and badminton, and 30 play both cricket and badminton. 20 members play all three games. (The \"both\" counts include those who play all three.)"});
